    "name": {
      "value": "Talisman Dabbler"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "apg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "The classic idea of magic is that of a hoary wizard, poring over a crumbling book of spells. But magic is so much more than that\u2014it is thought, will, and action, and with the right talismans, you can make even the cut of a sword a deeply magical act. This all hinges on the small magical talismans you affix to your gear. You know how to make and use the perfect talismans for any job."
    },
