                    "level": {
                      "value": 4
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You can attach a talisman using only a bit of glue and some string. You gain the Rapid Affixture skill feat, even if you don't meet the prerequisites.\n\nWhen you use it, you can affix or remove up to four talismans in 1 minute instead of just one.\n\nYou gain the ability to Affix a Talisman as a 3-action activity from that feat at 12th level, regardless of your Crafting proficiency."
